                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "v1",
                    "login_with_password"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Authenticate a user with the `email` and `password` that they provided when registering.\n\nGiven that the user credentials are correct, this returns a `token` that can then be used to authorise\nother secured operations. In case the password is expired, a temporary `token` is returned, which can be used\nsolely for updating the password.\n\nThe token returned is valid for 5 minutes from last activity."
